  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2201.02 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2201.02 Definitions. For purposes of this chapter, the following definitions shall apply:\n\n(a) “Department” means “department” as defined in RSA 149-R:2, II;\n\n(b) “Disposal facility” means a facility that holds a permit issued pursuant to RSA 149-M for a New Hampshire landfill, incinerator, or waste-to-energy facility;\n\n(c) “Fund” means “fund” as defined in RSA 149-R:2, III; and\n\n(d) “Surcharge” means the solid waste disposal surcharge established pursuant to RSA 149-R:5.\n\nSource. #14422, INTERIM, eff 1-1-26; ss by #14633, eff 7-1-26, EXPIRES: 7-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw2200.html"
